## Iridium 1.0.10 - Dashboard UI Polish

### Fixed
- Fixed traffic card dividers (was using wrong CSS variable)
- Increased card body and header padding for better spacing
- Improved info-box spacing and icon borders
- Unified styling for all dashboard elements

### Changed
- Info-box icons now larger (56px) with rounded borders
- Card content padding increased from 1.25rem to 1.5rem
- Better gap between info-box items in rows
